---
description: Analyze risky migrations before execution
globs:
  - "database/migrations/**"
  - "prisma/**"
  - "**/*.sql"
---

- never run destructive reset/drop-all migration commands in production
- analyze DROP, rename, type changes, NOT NULL changes, unique/index and FK changes
- prefer expand/migrate/contract for compatibility-sensitive production changes
- do not auto-run destructive migrations after generating them
- separate large backfills when practical
